    "terms.deliverables.1": "Under the proposed workflow, compensation remains pending until all required deliverables have been validated. It is recorded as paid when the corresponding payment is confirmed, and an incident affecting it must be visible. Validation alone does not prove a bank transfer. Payment methods, timing and evidence must be agreed before participation. This website does not hold funds or provide escrow.",
