    "terms.incidents.1": "Cancellation consequences, accepted work and any payment or refund must be assessed against the accepted conditions and mandatory law. Closing an account or cancelling a campaign does not erase accrued obligations. CollabPro does not replace courts or competent authorities, and an internal review does not prevent a user from exercising statutory rights.",
