    "terms.plans.1": "Before any real purchase, the user must see the total charge, currency, taxes where applicable, billing period, included features, commission calculation basis, who pays it and any additional charges. No campaign fee may be collected without disclosure and acceptance of these details. The landing’s plan buttons only select an option in the demonstration form.",
