    "terms.payments.1": "Payment provider fees, transaction timing and any limitations must be disclosed before authorization. Businesses and creators remain responsible for their lawful invoices and tax obligations. The website neither collects card details nor processes charges. Users must not enter banking credentials, security codes or account passwords in the demonstration form.",
    "terms.content.title": "10. Intellectual property and confidentiality",
