    "terms.content.1": "Users must hold the required rights to images, music, trademarks and third party material, and obtain permission for identifiable people when required. Private briefs, unpublished content, credentials and commercial information must not be disclosed without authorization. CollabPro’s brand and interface must not be used to imply endorsement or ownership. Third party assets retain their respective licenses.",
