    "terms.conduct.1": "Commercial collaborations must identify advertising or sponsorship when required by law or the publishing platform. Claims about products and services must be truthful and supported. Companies must not demand misleading endorsements, concealed advertising or content that creates foreseeable harm. Creators may decline conditions that are unlawful or incompatible with their professional integrity.",
