    "terms.metrics.1": "Links and codes may support attribution when that feature is enabled and appropriately disclosed. Attributed results are estimates influenced by available data and methodology. They do not establish causation or guarantee sales, return on investment, reach or income. Users must interpret them with caution and must not alter evidence to mislead another participant.",
