    "terms.thirdparties.1": "This website loads Inter and Roboto through Google Fonts. The browser makes requests to Google to obtain the styles and font files, subject to its privacy information. The hosting provider may also handle technical access logs. External links do not imply endorsement. No product or team video is loaded in the current landing.",
