    "terms.privacy.1": "Before real account creation, messaging or payment services are enabled, the responsible operator must be identified and provide a specific privacy notice stating purposes, legal bases, required and optional data, recipients, retention criteria, international transfers where applicable and real channels for exercising access, correction, cancellation and opposition rights. Accepting these terms does not authorize unrelated processing or promotional use.",
